{"agentId":"a00714bb97a5fae10","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","cwd":"/home/user/HeadacheRecording","entrypoint":"remote","gitBranch":"claude/determined-keller-1oTSo","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"text":"The app is built, committed, and pushed. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n**Files written/modified:**\n\n- `/home/user/HeadacheRecording/src/App.tsx` - Main layout with month navigation, today button, and PDF export button. Manages state and renders all child components.\n- `/home/user/HeadacheRecording/src/MonthlyStats.tsx` - Statistics panel showing headache days per severity level and medication usage counts/days.\n- `/home/user/HeadacheRecording/src/PDFExport.tsx` - Pure jsPDF-based PDF generation (no html2canvas needed) that draws a color-coded calendar grid, legend, statistics table, and medication day list.\n\n**Already existing files that were used as-is:**\n- `src/types.ts` - HeadacheLevel/Medication/DayRecord types, HEADACHE_LEVELS and MEDICATIONS constants\n- `src/storage.ts` - localStorage read/write helpers\n- `src/CalendarView.tsx` - Monthly calendar grid with colored cells\n- `src/DayModal.tsx` - Modal for adding/editing headache level, medications (with time picker), and notes\n- `src/index.css` - Tailwind v4 import + base styles\n\n**Build output:** 223 modules transformed, compiled successfully in 290ms.","type":"text"}],"diagnostics":null,"id":"msg_01Ni6LSRVJ13xtoEGd5WNUJu","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":148},"cache_creation_input_tokens":148,"cache_read_input_tokens":26162,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"}},"parentUuid":"2446e4d2-3f6e-4790-bc5c-fa240337600a","requestId":"req_011CbmTki9e8Svm6KiP28doP","sessionId":"049d03a0-a4cb-507f-a2bf-0f606bd0e31c","timestamp":"2026-06-06T05:34:40.